{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-1-intro","title":"1 Corinthians 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>the God. 16:20; 1Co 14:33; 2Co 5:19,20; 13:11; Php 4:9; 1Th 5:23; 2Th 3:16 Heb 13:20 be. 16:24; Ru 2:4; Mt 1:23; 28:20; 2Co 13:14; 2Ti 4:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-1","title":"1 Corinthians 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 After his salutation and thanksgiving, 10 he exhorts them to unity, 12 and reproves their dissensions. 18 God destroys the wisdom of the wise, 21 by the foolishness of preaching; 26 and calls not the wise, mighty, and noble, 28 but the foolish, weak, and men of no account.</p>\n<p>called. Ro 1:1; Ga 2:7,8 an. 3:9; 9:1,2; 15:9; Lu 6:13; Joh 20:21; Ac 1:2,25,26; 22:21; Ro 1:5 2Co 11:5; 12:12; Ga 1:1; Eph 4:11; 1Ti 1:1; 2:7 through. 6:16,17; Joh 15:16; 2Co 1:1; Ga 1:15,16; Eph 1:1; Col 1:1 Sosthenes. Ac 18:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-2","title":"1 Corinthians 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the church. Ac 18:1,8-11; 2Co 1:1; Ga 1:2; 1Th 1:1; 2Th 1:1; 1Ti 3:15 to them. Jude 1:1 sanctified. 30; 6:9-11; Joh 17:17-19; Ac 15:9; 26:18; Eph 5:26; Heb 2:11; 10:10 Heb 13:12 called. Ro 1:7; 1Th 4:7; 2Ti 1:9; 1Pe 1:15,16 with. Ac 7:59,60; 9:14,21; 22:16; 2Th 2:16,17; 2Ti 2:22 call.[Tois epikaloumenois to onoma .] That these words ought not to be rendered passively, is evident from the LXX., who translate the phrase [yikra be-shem,] \"he shall call on the name\" which is active, by [epikalesetai en onomati Theou,] or [en onomati Kyriou.]</p>\n<p>Ge 4:26; 12:8; 13:4-7,8-13 our Lord. 8:6; Ps 45:11; Ac 10:36; Ro 3:22; 10:12; 14:8,9; 2Co 4:5; Php 2:9-11 Re 19:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-3","title":"1 Corinthians 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Ro 1:7; 2Co 1:2; Eph 1:2; 1Pe 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-4","title":"1 Corinthians 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>thank. Ro 1:8; 6:17; Ac 11:23; 21:20 the grace. 3; Joh 10:30; 14:14,16,26; 15:26; 1Ti 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-5","title":"1 Corinthians 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>in every. 4:7-10; Ro 11:12; 2Co 9:11; Eph 2:7; 3:8 in all. 12:8,10; 14:5,6,26; Ac 2:4; 2Co 8:7; Eph 6:19; Col 4:3,4 and in. 8:11; 13:2,8; Ro 15:4; 2Co 4:6; Eph 1:17; Php 1:9; Col 1:9,10; 2:3 Col 3:10; Jas 3:13; 2Pe 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-6","title":"1 Corinthians 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the. 2:1,2; Ac 18:5; 20:21,24; 22:18; 23:11; 28:23; 1Ti 2:6; 2Ti 1:8 1Jo 5:11-13; Re 1:2,9; 6:9; 12:11,17; 19:10 was. Mr 16:20; Ac 11:17,21; Ro 15:19; 2Co 12:12; Ga 3:5; Heb 2:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-7","title":"1 Corinthians 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>ye. 2Co 12:13 waiting. 4:5; Ge 49:18; Mt 25:1; Lu 12:36; Ro 8:19; Php 3:20; 1Th 1:10 2Ti 4:8; Tit 2:13; Heb 9:28; 10:36,37; Jas 5:7,8; 2Pe 3:12; Jude 1:21 coming. Gr. revelation. Lu 17:30; Col 3:4; 2Th 1:7; 1Ti 6:14,15; 1Pe 1:13; 4:13; 5:4; 1Jo 3:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-8","title":"1 Corinthians 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>confirm. Ps 37:17,28; Ro 14:4; 16:25; 2Co 1:21; 1Th 3:13; 5:24; 2Th 3:3 1Pe 5:10 blameless. Eph 5:27; Php 2:15; Col 1:22; 1Th 3:13; 5:23,24; 2Pe 3:14 Jude 1:24,25 the day. Php 1:6,10; 2:16; 2Pe 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-9","title":"1 Corinthians 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>God. 10:13; Nu 23:19; De 7:9; 32:4; Ps 89:33-35; 100:5; Isa 11:5; 25:1 Isa 49:7; La 3:22,23; Mt 24:35; 1Th 5:23,24; 2Th 3:3; Tit 1:2 Heb 2:17; 6:18; 10:23; 11:11; Re 19:11 by. Col 1:24; Ro 8:28,30; 9:24; Ga 1:15; 1Th 2:12; 2Th 2:14; 2Ti 1:9 Heb 3:1; 1Pe 5:10 the fellowship. 30; 10:16; Joh 15:4,5; 17:21; Ro 11:17; Ga 2:20; Eph 2:20-22; 3:6 Heb 3:14; 1Jo 1:3,7; 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-10","title":"1 Corinthians 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I beseech. 4:16; Ro 12:1; 2Co 5:20; 6:1; 10:1; Ga 4:12; Eph 4:1; Phm 1:9,10 1Pe 2:11 by the. Ro 15:30; 1Th 4:1,2; 2Th 2:1; 1Ti 5:21; 2Ti 4:1 that ye. Ps 133:1; Jer 32:39; Joh 13:34,35; 17:23; Ac 4:32; Ro 12:16; 15:5,6 Ro 16:17; 2Co 13:11; Eph 4:1-7,31,32; Php 1:27; 2:1-4; 3:16 1Th 5:13; Jas 3:13-18; 1Pe 3:8,9 divisions. Gr. schisms. 11:18; 12:25; Mt 9:16; Mr 2:21; Joh 7:43; 9:16; 10:19; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-11","title":"1 Corinthians 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>it hath. 11:18; Ge 27:42; 37:2; 1Sa 25:14-17 that there. 3:3; 6:1-7; Pr 13:10; 18:6; 2Co 12:20; Ga 5:15,20,26; Php 2:14 1Ti 6:4; 2Ti 2:23-25; Jas 4:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-12","title":"1 Corinthians 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>this. 7:29; 15:50; 2Co 9:6; Ga 3:17 I am. 3:4-6,21-23; 4:6 Apollos. 16:12; Ac 18:24-28; 19:1 Cephas. 9:5; 15:5; Joh 1:42; Ga 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-13","title":"1 Corinthians 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Christ. 2Co 11:4; Ga 1:7; Eph 4:5 Paul. 6:19,20; Ro 14:9; 2Co 5:14,15; Tit 2:14 or. 15; 10:2; Mt 28:19; Ac 2:38; 10:48; 19:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-14","title":"1 Corinthians 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>thank. 4; 14:18; 2Co 2:14; Eph 5:20; Col 3:15,17; 1Th 5:18; 1Ti 1:12; Phm 1:4 Crispus. Ac 18:8 Gaius. Ro 16:23; 3Jo 1:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-15","title":"1 Corinthians 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I. Joh 3:28,29; 7:18; 2Co 11:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-16","title":"1 Corinthians 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>household. 16:15,17; Ac 16:15,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-17","title":"1 Corinthians 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>not to. Joh 4:2; Ac 10:48; 26:17,18 not. 2:1,4,13; 2Co 4:2; 10:3,4,10; 2Pe 1:16 words. or, speech. 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-18","title":"1 Corinthians 1:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the preaching. 23,24; 2:2; Ga 6:12-14 to. Ac 13:41; 2Co 2:15,16; 4:3; 2Th 2:10 foolishness. 21,23,25; 2:14; 3:19; Ac 17:18,32 unto. 24; 15:2; Ps 110:2,3; Ro 1:16; 2Co 10:4; 1Th 1:5; Heb 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-19","title":"1 Corinthians 1:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>3:19; Job 5:12,13; Isa 19:3,11; 29:14; Jer 8:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-20","title":"1 Corinthians 1:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>is the wise. Isa 33:18; 53:1 hath. 19; 2Sa 15:31; 16:23; 17:14,23; Job 12:17,20,24; Isa 44:25; Ro 1:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-21","title":"1 Corinthians 1:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>in. 24; Da 2:20; Ro 11:33; Eph 3:10 the wisdom.Dr. Lightfoot well observes, \"that [sophia tou theos ,] the wisdom of God, is not to be understood of that wisdom which had God for its author, but of that wisdom which had God for its object. There was, among the heathen, [sophia tes physeos,] wisdom about natural things, that is philosophy; and [sophia tou theos ,] wisdom about God, that is, divinity. But the world, in its divinity, could not, by wisdom, know God.\" The wisest of the heathen had no just and correct views of the Divine nature; of which the works of Cicero and Lucretius are incontestable proofs.</p>\n<p>the world. Mt 11:25; Lu 10:21; Ro 1:20-22,28 the foolishness. 18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-22","title":"1 Corinthians 1:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>the Jews. Mt 12:38,39; 16:1-4; Mr 8:11; Lu 11:16,20; Joh 2:18; 4:28 the Greeks. Ac 17:18-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-23","title":"1 Corinthians 1:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>we. 18; 2:2; Lu 24:46,47; Ac 7:32-35; 10:39-43; 2Co 4:5; Ga 3:1; 6:14 Eph 3:8 unto the Jews. Isa 8:14,15; Mt 11:6; 13:57; Lu 2:34; Joh 6:53-66; Ro 9:32,33 Ga 5:11; 1Pe 2:8 foolishness. 28; 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-24","title":"1 Corinthians 1:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>called. 2,9; Lu 7:35; Ro 8:28-30; 9:24 the power. 18; Ro 1:4,16 the wisdom. 30; Pr 8:1,22-30; Col 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-25","title":"1 Corinthians 1:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>the foolishness. 18,27-29; Ex 13:17; 14:2-4; Jos 6:2-5; Jud 7:2-8; 15:15,16 1Sa 17:40-51; 1Ki 20:14-22; Zec 4:6,7; 12:7,8; Ro 11:33-36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-26","title":"1 Corinthians 1:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>that. 20; 2:3-6,13; 3:18-20; Zep 3:12; Mt 11:25,26; Lu 10:21; Joh 7:47-49 Jas 3:13-17 not many mighty. Lu 1:3; *Gr: Lu 18:24,25; Joh 4:46-53; 19:38,39; Ac 13:7,12; 17:34; Php 4:22 Jas 1:9-11; 2:5; 2Jo 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-27","title":"1 Corinthians 1:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Ps 8:2; Isa 26:5,6; 29:14,19; Zep 3:12; Mt 4:18-22; 9:9; 11:25 Mt 21:16; Lu 19:39,40; 21:15; Ac 4:11-21; 6:9,10; 7:35,54; 17:18 Ac 24:24,25; 2Co 4:7; 10:4,5,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-28","title":"1 Corinthians 1:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>things which. Ro 4:17; 2Co 12:11 to bring. 2:6; De 28:63; Job 34:19,20,24; Ps 32:10; 37:35,36; Isa 2:11,17 Isa 17:13,14; 37:36; 41:12; Da 2:34,35,44,45; Re 18:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-29","title":"1 Corinthians 1:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>31; 4:7; 5:6; Ps 49:6; Isa 10:15; Jer 9:23; Ro 3:19,27; 4:2; 15:17 Eph 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-30","title":"1 Corinthians 1:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>in. 12:18,27; Isa 45:17; Joh 15:1-6; 17:21-23; Ro 8:1; 12:5; 16:7,11 2Co 5:17; 12:2; Eph 1:3,4,10; 2:10 of God. Ro 11:36; 2Co 5:18-21 wisdom. 24; 12:8; Pr 1:20; 2:6; 8:5; Da 2:20; Lu 21:15; Joh 1:18; 8:12; 14:6 Joh 17:8,26; 2Co 4:6; Eph 1:17,18; 3:9,10; Col 2:2,3; 3:16 2Ti 3:15-17; Jas 1:5 righteousness. Ps 71:15,16; Isa 45:24,25; 54:17; Jer 23:5,6; 33:16; Da 9:24 Ro 1:17; 3:21-24; 4:6,25; 5:19,21; 2Co 5:21; Php 3:9; 2Pe 1:1 sanctification. 2; 6:11; Mt 1:21; Joh 17:17-19; Ac 26:18; Ro 8:9; Ga 5:22-24 Eph 2:10; 5:26; 1Pe 1:2; 1Jo 5:6 redemption. 15:54-57; Ho 13:14; Ro 3:24; 8:23; Ga 1:4; 3:13; Eph 1:7; 4:30 Col 1:14; Tit 2:14; Heb 9:12; 1Pe 1:18,19; Re 5:9; 14:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-1-31","title":"1 Corinthians 1:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>1Ch 16:10,35; Ps 105:3; Isa 41:16; 45:25; Jer 4:2; 9:23,24 2Co 10:17; Ga 6:13,14; Php 3:3; *Gr:</p>"}]}